-- AutoBlackflash: integrated external UI + macro + chain + 16-frame kill finisher.
-- Based on the client source supplied in this conversation. ASCII-only. Not live-tested.
-- Keeps category/search UI, popup preview, drag, scaling, minimize, reopen and unload.
-- Repairs the supplied chain's missing implementation and toggle forward declaration.
-- Finisher: 16 logical frames at 14 FPS (approximately 1.143 seconds).
-- Default ConfirmedOnly uses the BlackflashKillConfirmed server RemoteEvent from
-- the previous package. It does not fabricate that remote or send a client kill claim.
-- Optional EstimatedLethal mode is explicitly NOT verified attacker/Black Flash attribution.
